Keep Annex-B encoder output

With this flag the camera asks the encoder for NAL length prefixes instead of start codes, which
AOSP's MPEG4Writer does not expect: the recorded file is broken. The flag is read as false.

--- a/xb/f.smali
+++ b/xb/f.smali
@@ -711,7 +711,7 @@
 
     iget-object v4, v2, Lxb/b;->e:Lxb/q;
 
-    iget-boolean v7, v4, Lxb/q;->y:Z
+    const/4 v7, 0x0
 
     if-eqz v7, :cond_2a4
 
